{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2c9ecc22452ff7420b53e9fc5fdbe2bf204d88df1178a2179423abcc190de299", "ja": "（琴葉達のウェディングドレス姿を撮影した\n雑誌が届いた。早速、琴葉に見せよう）", "zh": "（收到刊载琴叶她们婚纱写真照的杂志了。\n赶快拿去给琴叶看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "910af927ae3f0ff00d148cfe699f7ff4a5eb0cc0ce2294c879b1420814e61666", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n何かありましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，工作辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "600b33f0bb3a57773c1bd7746373aff4b12c07e45f2aef804b5ef440b7ce6c29", "ja": "いや、特に急ぎじゃないんだけど……\nこの前撮影した雑誌が届いたから、持ってきたんだ。", "zh": "不，没什么急事……\n只是收到之前拍摄写真照的杂志，所以我就拿过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "83207882f917101bd7489b631554a8c6fa105ef1ef0ef6fcfc89be3a39129939", "ja": "え？　この前って……もしかして、\nう、ウェディングドレスの……？", "zh": "咦？你说之前……\n该不会，是婚、婚纱的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9cc09f67d2d8452509838c0f68f565af579fdef14ece73172c30dddcb005c4a2", "ja": "そうだよ。ほら、このページに琴葉が……。", "zh": "对啊。你看，这页有琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "bcf38926f26ee8f70d3e91cec8574a1e7da2ff11eac527646bfd9012815a2dc7", "ja": "きゃああああああっ！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "716fe32c9feac9318651a16831f2f12a0094e8244e70b1f11855df165a1a57dc", "ja": "！？　ど、どうした琴葉！", "zh": "咦！？怎、怎么了，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "eab06a2cc909ffc936a13bf3214abf4801505c62960f0a8d3f2795d91aa59aaf", "ja": "あっ……す、すみません！\n急に大きな声を出してしまって……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！\n我突然喊这么大声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "d107291c3512ce567f1e440911fbf287dd7b6a1ca56828590a6fa76724695e38", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。今は、そのページを\n開かないでもらえますか。ちょっと、心の準備が……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n可以先别打开那一页吗？我要做点心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "31b4cc909e30c485c0eb607566c8141e013f29344a99ae90e56eac4e9358ae6c", "ja": "心の準備？", "zh": "心理准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "5a4682d585b9f52ece2c9bd64e7187f7ec1abaf2e8903ff85d0a12a9da7ea6a2", "ja": "あの時、私……すごく、はしゃいでしまって……\nどんな顔をして写っているのかと思うと……。", "zh": "因为那时候我……很兴奋……\n一想到不知道被拍到怎样的表情，我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "16f97c07b9c2dd3472bae421a6df911187f0ccf39e1fef9cf991aa69c6dd01bd", "ja": "だから、自分の顔を見る勇気が出るまで、\n少しだけ待ってもらえませんか……。", "zh": "所以直到我鼓起勇气看自己的脸为止，\n你可以等我一下下吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "89e6ca5cc05dba809bae310e0b86fbbaffdfcc75a9f4347a2e5ca47a9a2e4c26", "ja": "大げさだな、琴葉は。心配しなくても\nすごくいい笑顔だし、綺麗に写ってるよ。", "zh": "琴叶你想得太夸张了啦。\n不用担心，你的笑容很美，拍得很漂亮喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "08a591d0e85c9ab46be8f403e023da66285b5a72029bd8e926b74d53097a288a", "ja": "えっ？　き、綺麗……ですか。", "zh": "咦？漂、漂亮……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7fabf3f5c1c46df121b664f430099310629843a7157b10d86c1d13c23ff23edf", "ja": "もちろん！　綺麗だし、可愛い。\n琴葉はウェディングドレスが似合うんだな。", "zh": "那当然！不但漂亮，又可爱。\n琴叶你很适合穿婚纱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "8d45c8c8857c1eba1a46ace15407d6fede68a2186f4454e3bad394df6004e332", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあ、え、ええと……ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "咦咦！？\n啊，呃，那个……谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "e2fcdc561928d0237cce923f36793cb531ac914e1a5683d3f6f9c4c28234df04", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}。\nやっぱり……。", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}。\n我还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1018_p", "source_sha256": "99ed975d5431bcc1c3cec924587c75d5f5c401a21201f6b1e7b25f428d803e68", "ja": "はは、見る気になったか？", "zh": "哈哈，想看了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "1ee11318565d074e1be876fb1010e93294cc517e8846370a1d38e201dff3f514", "ja": "す、すみません……そんなふうに言われると、\nなんだか気になってしまって……。", "zh": "不、不好意思……\n被你这么一说，让我忍不住很在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "50b9ccc6e10590eb94dc380daa25b25af945dd72be3ec95c9b2602bc45dfdef7", "ja": "で、では……。あっ……私、嬉しそう……。\nこ、こんな顔してたんだ……ふふっ……♪", "zh": "那、那我要看了……啊……我看起来好高兴……\n原、原来我露出了这样的表情啊……呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0054_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5102993105cf1c4ce9800de9d269aafa134cbfab5e2f9aa1bb8329152adab08f", "ja": "（大切なものを確かめるように、琴葉は何度も自分の\n写真を眺めていた。少しは、自信に繋がったかな？）", "zh": "（仿佛在确认重要事物般，琴叶看了自己的照片无数次。\n应该多少有让她建立起自信吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
